Notes for next week:
- 3 Chrome extensions were connected; selecting the browser needs Adi (switch_browser). Unattended runs stop there.
- This Chrome profile blocks multiple automatic downloads: download all voices as ONE combined file (JSON header + concatenated mp3s), split in the container.
- The Studio tab must be the active tab in a front window ("hidden" tab = uploads stall; once uploaded, editing works hidden).
- Drop "both_mixes" from jobs (TikTok only) - saves ~8 min per build. Start builds with setsid nohup (plain nohup jobs died).
- AI-generated toggle is not remembered between uploads; check it every time.
